Description: next generation HTTP client (v2 line, installs as httpx2)
 httpx2 is Pydantic's actively-developed next-generation rewrite of
 httpx (the "v2" line of the httpx/httpcore ecosystem, built on top of
 httpcore2). It installs its own top-level "httpx2" Python module, side
 by side with the unrelated, still separately maintained python3-httpx
 ("v1" httpx) package.
 .
 Packaged to satisfy mcp (>= 2.0.0b2)'s direct dependency on httpx2,
 needed for the fastmcp 4.0.0a2 migration.
